# Part 4 – Smooth Navigation

## What I Learned

Instead of jumping instantly to sections, navigation links scroll smoothly.

Using CSS:

```css
html{
    scroll-behavior:smooth;
}
```

Navigation links were also improved using hover animations.

Example:

```css
nav a{
    transition: color .3s ease,
                transform .3s ease;
}

nav a:hover{
    color:#60a5fa;
    transform:translateY(-3px);
}
```

Animated underline:

```css
nav a::after{
    width:0;
    transition:width .3s ease;
}

nav a:hover::after{
    width:100%;
}
```

